<title>UK: EIB adds 100 million marks to December 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>EIB adds 100 million marks to December 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 400 million marks from 300 million marks, joint lead managers Credit Suisse First Boston and SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT   *400 MKN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.205   PAY DATE  S-20.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     LISTING    =	   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>	   *DEAL WAS ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED ON 15.JAN.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
